        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International BP-7821, Plain Cabinet Knob Backplate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Stepped Cabinet Rosette is a great way to add beauty to any cabinet knob. It installs simply by sliding on the knob's installation screw before threading the knob on. The 1-5/8 Inch Round Stepped Cabinet Knob Rose is great for use with most traditional style knobs such as this <a href=\"/products/simple-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-1118\">Simple Cabinet Knob</a>. It is available in 7 finishes (click on picture to the right to see them all).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International BP-7821, Traditional Knob Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/oil-bronze-crab.jpg?v=1704354545\" width=\"586\" height=\"116\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
